function V3FAQ(){return <section id="faq" className="v3-wrap v3-section v3-faq"><div><h2>Real estate marketing questions.<em>Answered before we talk.</em></h2><p className="v3-faq-intro">The practical details: scope, spend, leads and the way we work.</p><a className="v3-faq-guide" href="https://qdnco.com/guides/">Explore all published guides ↗</a><a className="v3-faq-guide" href="https://qdnco.com/answers/">More real estate marketing answers ↗</a></div><div>{[["Who is QDnCo built for?", V3_DUBAI?"Dubai realtors (channel partners), developers and mandate firms marketing off-plan or ready properties to local and international buyers.":"Developers, channel partners and mandate firms with real inventory, a defined market and a sales team ready to follow up."], ["What is included in Meta/Google Ad Campaigns?", V3_DUBAI?"Research, strategy, campaign management, lead capture, CRM routing and weekly reporting. Dubai campaign engagements include 15 static AI creatives per month plus AI copy and fatigue refreshes. Studio production is quoted separately.":"Market research, positioning, strategy, campaign launch and management, weekly reporting and a dedicated relationship manager. Ad creatives and Meta asset setup are included as required, without extra charges."], ["Who pays for the advertising spend?", "You pay Meta/Google directly. Your ad accounts stay in your name. Our agency fee is separate from the media budget."], ["What counts as a qualified lead?", "We agree the criteria before launch: contactability, buyer budget, location fit, purchase timing and intent. Qualification, a site visit and a confirmed booking are separate stages."], ["What is a good cost per lead for real estate?", "There is no single benchmark for every project. Price, location, audience, platform and buyer intent change the cost. We review cost per qualified lead alongside sales feedback, not just cheap enquiries."], ["How much should we budget for a launch?", "Start with your project, buyer audience and test period. Agree a spending cap before launch, then scale against lead quality and campaign evidence. Use our pricing calculator to explore the agency retainer; media spend is additional."], ["Can you connect campaigns with CRM and WhatsApp?", "Yes. CRM setup, lead routing, landing pages and AI lead follow-up can be scoped together. Your sales team handles buyer conversations, visits, negotiation and closing."], ["How do you improve Google and AI-search visibility?", "Our combined SEO and AI Search Optimization service covers search content, AEO, GEO, business listings, relevant citations and digital PR. We build around real buyer questions and useful evidence."], ["What reporting will we receive?", "Weekly campaign reporting, with spend, lead costs, qualification feedback and the next actions. Your dedicated relationship manager keeps the work connected to your sales team."], ["How do you approach real estate advertising compliance?", "Project details, registration information and claims are checked against the approved brief before launch. The campaign uses confirmed project information and the required market-specific disclosures."], ["How do we start?", "Share your business type, project and required services through the contact page. Review the indicative agency cost, then discuss the scope and next steps with our team."]].map(([q,a])=><details key={q}><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>}
